; -- External symbols --
WBOOT_VEC            EQU $0000               ; Warm-boot vector — JP WBOOT in BIOS. Touching it causes a CP/M warm boot.
IOBYTE               EQU $0003               ; [DOC S&HD 2-18..2-21] I/O assignment byte at $0003: maps four logical
